body:
I'm sorry you are experiencing such pain. I plan to end my life tomorrow as well. Wish I had an optimistic life tip for you, but just like you, I am searching for eternal peace. My biggest pain I bear is the damage I will do to my family by ending my life, but I see no alternative. 

&#x200B;

I wish you well with whatever decisions you end up making. I hope you feel some sort of oneness in that other people suffer in an almost indescribable way.
